# ⚠️ KEYS ARE PER-ENVIRONMENT, like app.conf above. `jwt_public_key_path` can
# now be written repo-relative (`config/jwt/jwt_rs256.key.pub`) so ONE config
# value works on a laptop and in a container — but the file itself must be
# placed per environment, not committed. Stage and prod may not share a
# keypair, and a committed key is one that cannot differ.
